      "sublabel": "nvidia-smi + hwmon + /proc/stat",
      "note": "read_gpu_sensors() shells nvidia-smi (temp/util/power/limit/fan per index); _find_cpu_temp_input() probes hwmon for k10temp/zenpower/coretemp; _CpuUtil reads /proc/stat deltas. Gated by _endpoint_is_local() and throttled to SENSOR_SECS=5. Every reading degrades to None rather than raising.",
